Caption label → Height:

If(varBig, 80, 40)

If the label's Y formula subtracts a fixed number, it will drift when the height changes. Anchor it to its own height instead:

Y = If(
    varBig,
    App.Height - Self.Height - 60,
    Container8_12.Y + Video1.Y + Video1.Height - Self.Height - 40
)

Also set VerticalAlign = VerticalAlign.Middle so short lines sit centered in the taller box.


Width — estimated from character count
Width = Min(
    Len(Self.Text) * Self.Size * 0.55 + 40,
    Video1.Width - 40
)

Keep it centered under the video:

X = If(
    varBig,
    (App.Width - Self.Width) / 2,
    Container8_12.X + Video1.X + (Video1.Width - Self.Width) / 2
)
